<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Token Broker – Getting started</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/</link><description>Recent content in Getting started on Token Broker</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-US</language><atom:link href="https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Claude Code plugin</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/claude-code/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/claude-code/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Install the &lt;code&gt;agent-token&lt;/code&gt; plugin so Claude Code on your host commits and calls GitHub as the agent
app instead of as you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="before-you-start"&gt;Before you start&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="before-you-start"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#before-you-start" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt; (logged in), &lt;code&gt;curl&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;git&lt;/code&gt; on the host.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The agent app is installed on your repository, and the repository carries the topic
&lt;code&gt;agent-token-broker&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The broker&amp;rsquo;s URL. The plugin looks for it in this order: the &lt;code&gt;TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/code&gt; environment
variable, the plugin option &lt;code&gt;broker_url&lt;/code&gt;, the Actions variable &lt;code&gt;AGENT_TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/code&gt; of the
repository&amp;rsquo;s organization, read with your &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt;. Repository variables are ignored, so a repository
admin cannot send your login to another server. Only &lt;code&gt;https://&lt;/code&gt; URLs are accepted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="install"&gt;Install&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="install"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#install" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;claude plugin marketplace add pflege-de-labs/token-broker
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;claude plugin install agent-token@pflege-de-token-broker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To set the broker URL at install time, add &lt;code&gt;--config broker_url=https://&amp;lt;broker&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;. You can also
set it later in Claude Code with &lt;code&gt;/config&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The plugin carries the client scripts: its &lt;code&gt;bin/&lt;/code&gt; directory is on the PATH of Claude&amp;rsquo;s Bash tool.
Your own &lt;code&gt;PATH&lt;/code&gt; comes first, so a Homebrew or script install wins. The plugin tracks &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt;, while
Homebrew, the install script and the containers install pinned releases. Marketplace auto-update
is off by default; update with &lt;code&gt;claude plugin update agent-token@pflege-de-token-broker&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="log-in"&gt;Log in&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="log-in"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#log-in" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once per 8 hours, in the Claude Code prompt:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;! agent-token --login&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first login prints a code for &lt;a href="https://github.com/login/device" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/login/device&lt;/a&gt;. The login token is cached in
&lt;code&gt;~/.cache/agent-token/login.json&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="what-happens-in-a-session"&gt;What happens in a session&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="what-happens-in-a-session"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#what-happens-in-a-session" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A &lt;code&gt;SessionStart&lt;/code&gt; hook checks whether the repository carries the topic &lt;code&gt;agent-token-broker&lt;/code&gt;. If it
does, Claude is told to commit and call GitHub with agent tokens, and the hook adds the result of
&lt;code&gt;agent-token --check&lt;/code&gt;. In every other directory the plugin stays silent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In such a session a &lt;code&gt;PreToolUse&lt;/code&gt; hook blocks Bash commands that contain &lt;code&gt;git commit&lt;/code&gt; or
&lt;code&gt;git push&lt;/code&gt;, and a bare &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt; where &lt;code&gt;agent-gh&lt;/code&gt; exists. Claude uses &lt;a href="../../guides/signed-commits/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-commit&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
and &lt;code&gt;agent-gh&lt;/code&gt; instead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-amber-200 hx:bg-amber-100 hx:text-amber-900 hx:dark:border-amber-200/30 hx:dark:bg-amber-900/30 hx:dark:text-amber-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;The plugin is a guardrail, not a sandbox. The hook matches command text, so &lt;code&gt;env git push&lt;/code&gt; or a
script that pushes get through with your credentials. For isolation use the
&lt;a href="../container/"&gt;container&lt;/a&gt; or the &lt;a href="../devcontainer/"&gt;Dev Container&lt;/a&gt;. See the
&lt;a href="../../concepts/security-model/"&gt;security model&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="next-steps"&gt;Next steps&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="next-steps"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#next-steps" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="../../guides/signed-commits/"&gt;Sign agent commits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="../../reference/client-cli/"&gt;Client commands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Homebrew</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/homebrew/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/homebrew/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Install the client scripts on macOS or Linux with Homebrew. The formula depends on &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;brew tap pflege-de-labs/token-broker https://github.com/pflege-de-labs/token-broker
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;brew install agent-token&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set the broker URL and request a token:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;https://&amp;lt;broker&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;agent-token my-org/my-repo &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# prints a 1h agent token&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first run prints a code for &lt;a href="https://github.com/login/device" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/login/device&lt;/a&gt;. The login token is cached for 8
hours in &lt;code&gt;~/.cache/agent-token/login.json&lt;/code&gt; (mode 600), so later runs need no browser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Homebrew installs a pinned release. To use the scripts from Claude Code without managing the
install yourself, use the &lt;a href="../claude-code/"&gt;plugin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-blue-200 hx:bg-blue-100 hx:text-blue-900 hx:dark:border-blue-200/30 hx:dark:bg-blue-900/30 hx:dark:text-blue-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;Without a container, deny the agent read access to &lt;code&gt;~/.ssh&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;~/.config/gh&lt;/code&gt; and
&lt;code&gt;~/.cache/agent-token&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="../../reference/client-cli/"&gt;client commands&lt;/a&gt; for what each script does.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Install script</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/install-script/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/install-script/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Install the client scripts from a release tarball, without a package manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pflege-de-labs/token-broker/main/scripts/install.sh &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; bash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The script:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;downloads &lt;code&gt;agent-token-&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;.tar.gz&lt;/code&gt; from the release and verifies its sha256 against the
release&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;checksums.txt&lt;/code&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;installs the scripts into &lt;code&gt;$PREFIX/bin&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;PREFIX&lt;/code&gt; defaulting to &lt;code&gt;~/.local&lt;/code&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;installs &lt;code&gt;agent-gh&lt;/code&gt; as &lt;code&gt;agent-gh&lt;/code&gt;, never as &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt; on the host;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;never changes your global git config.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make sure &lt;code&gt;$PREFIX/bin&lt;/code&gt; is on your &lt;code&gt;PATH&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="pin-a-version"&gt;Pin a version&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="pin-a-version"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#pin-a-version" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pflege-de-labs/token-broker/main/scripts/install.sh &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; bash -s -- --version v0.6.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="choose-the-install-directory"&gt;Choose the install directory&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="choose-the-install-directory"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#choose-the-install-directory" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pflege-de-labs/token-broker/main/scripts/install.sh &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;PREFIX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/opt/agent bash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every &lt;code&gt;v*&lt;/code&gt; release carries &lt;code&gt;agent-token-&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;.tar.gz&lt;/code&gt; (the scripts in &lt;code&gt;bin/&lt;/code&gt;) and
&lt;code&gt;checksums.txt&lt;/code&gt;. The script needs &lt;code&gt;bash&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;curl&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt; is needed for &lt;code&gt;agent-gh&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Container</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/container/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/container/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-run&lt;/code&gt; starts Claude Code in a container whose only GitHub credential is an agent token for
one repository. Your SSH keys, &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt; login, git config and the broker login token stay on the host.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="before-you-start"&gt;Before you start&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="before-you-start"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#before-you-start" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;podman&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;curl&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;git&lt;/code&gt; on the host.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-token&lt;/code&gt; on your &lt;code&gt;PATH&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a href="../homebrew/"&gt;Homebrew&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href="../install-script/"&gt;install script&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clone of the &lt;a href="https://github.com/pflege-de-labs/token-broker" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;token-broker repository&lt;/a&gt;, which
holds &lt;code&gt;agent-run&lt;/code&gt; and the image definition in &lt;code&gt;container/&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="build-the-image"&gt;Build the image&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="build-the-image"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#build-the-image" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;podman build -t localhost/agent-sandbox:latest container/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="configure"&gt;Configure&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="configure"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#configure" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;https://&amp;lt;broker&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;AGENT_APP_SLUG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;agent app slug&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;from &lt;span class="sb"&gt;`&lt;/span&gt;claude setup-token&lt;span class="sb"&gt;`&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="run"&gt;Run&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="run"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#run" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;From inside a checkout (a clone or a git worktree):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;/path/to/token-broker/agent-run &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# repository from the `origin` remote&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;/path/to/token-broker/agent-run my-org/my-repo &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# explicit repository&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;/path/to/token-broker/agent-run -p &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;fix the failing test&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# arguments go to claude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-run&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;gets an agent token with &lt;code&gt;agent-token&lt;/code&gt; (device flow on first use) and renews it every 45
minutes while the session runs; the container reads it from a read-only file;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;mounts the checkout at the same path, plus the main repository&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;.git&lt;/code&gt; for worktrees;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;rewrites GitHub SSH remotes to HTTPS, so git pushes with the agent token;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sets the commit identity to &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;[bot] &amp;lt;&amp;lt;bot user ID&amp;gt;+&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;[bot]@users.noreply.github.com&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;keeps Claude Code&amp;rsquo;s settings in the named volume &lt;code&gt;agent-claude&lt;/code&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;maps your user to the container user, so files keep your ownership;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;installs the repository&amp;rsquo;s toolchain from &lt;code&gt;mise.toml&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;.tool-versions&lt;/code&gt; before Claude starts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;AGENT_IMAGE&lt;/code&gt; selects another image. &lt;code&gt;AGENT_PODMAN_ARGS&lt;/code&gt; adds podman flags, for example
&lt;code&gt;--entrypoint sh&lt;/code&gt; for a shell instead of Claude.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="toolchains"&gt;Toolchains&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="toolchains"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#toolchains" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The image holds only what every repository needs: git, &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;curl&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;make&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;unzip&lt;/code&gt;,
ripgrep, shellcheck, python3 and &lt;a href="https://mise.jdx.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;mise&lt;/a&gt;. Everything else comes from the
repository&amp;rsquo;s mise config at its pinned versions. Installs and caches live in the volumes
&lt;code&gt;agent-mise&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;agent-cache&lt;/code&gt;, so only the first session per version downloads. A repository
without a mise config gets no extra tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-run&lt;/code&gt; trusts the mise config of the mounted checkout only. A failed &lt;code&gt;mise install&lt;/code&gt; prints a
warning and Claude starts anyway.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-amber-200 hx:bg-amber-100 hx:text-amber-900 hx:dark:border-amber-200/30 hx:dark:bg-amber-900/30 hx:dark:text-amber-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;Never mount cloud credentials (&lt;code&gt;~/.aws&lt;/code&gt;, kubeconfigs): they are developer credentials. Let the
agent write code and run &lt;code&gt;terraform plan&lt;/code&gt; in CI instead.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="limits"&gt;Limits&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="limits"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#limits" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The token covers one repository: fetching private dependencies from other repositories, such as
Go modules, fails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commits are unsigned; merge agent pull requests with squash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;After 8 hours the login token expires and the next renewal prints a device code on the
terminal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Dev Container</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/devcontainer/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/devcontainer/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;agent-token&lt;/code&gt; Dev Container Feature installs the client scripts, pinned to a release, into a
devcontainer. It is published in
&lt;a href="https://github.com/pflege-de-labs/devcontainer-features#agent-token" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;pflege-de-labs/devcontainer-features&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The token-broker repository&amp;rsquo;s own
&lt;a href="https://github.com/pflege-de-labs/token-broker/tree/main/.devcontainer" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;.devcontainer/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is a
working setup to copy. It:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;installs the scripts with the Feature (pinned by digest in &lt;code&gt;devcontainer.json&lt;/code&gt;);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sets the bot identity and installs Claude Code and the toolchain from &lt;code&gt;mise.toml&lt;/code&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;adds a SessionStart hook as managed settings, which reminds you when the login is missing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;limits outbound traffic with an egress firewall to an allowlist of domains plus the broker host.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On first attach the terminal shows a device code; log in there. With Podman, set
&lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;dev.containers.dockerPath&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;podman&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; in your VS Code settings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="broker-url-and-login-app"&gt;Broker URL and login app&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="broker-url-and-login-app"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#broker-url-and-login-app" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two Actions variables supply the broker URL and the login app client ID, not the repository:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Variable&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Container environment&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;AGENT_TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;AGENT_LOGIN_CLIENT_ID&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;LOGIN_APP_CLIENT_ID&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A repository variable of the same name overrides the organization value. Nothing in the container
can read variables, so
&lt;a href="https://github.com/pflege-de-labs/token-broker/blob/main/.devcontainer/broker-env.sh" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;broker-env.sh&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
runs on the host as &lt;code&gt;initializeCommand&lt;/code&gt;. It needs &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt; (logged in, &lt;code&gt;repo&lt;/code&gt; scope) and &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;, reads
both variables for the &lt;code&gt;origin&lt;/code&gt; repository and writes &lt;code&gt;.devcontainer/.env&lt;/code&gt;, which &lt;code&gt;runArgs&lt;/code&gt; passes
with &lt;code&gt;--env-file&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-jsonc" data-lang="jsonc"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;initializeCommand&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;.devcontainer/broker-env.sh&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;runArgs&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;--env-file=${localWorkspaceFolder}/.devcontainer/.env&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="things-to-know"&gt;Things to know&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="things-to-know"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#things-to-know" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Everything committed or pushed in the container goes out as the agent app&amp;rsquo;s bot, including
commits from the VS Code Source Control view. Commit as yourself from the host.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The agent commits with &lt;a href="../../guides/signed-commits/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-commit&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, so branches that require
signatures accept them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VS Code forwards your credentials into devcontainers. The setup turns off
&lt;code&gt;git.terminalAuthentication&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;github.gitAuthentication&lt;/code&gt;, overrides &lt;code&gt;GIT_AUTHOR_*&lt;/code&gt; and
&lt;code&gt;GIT_COMMITTER_*&lt;/code&gt;, and has the credential helper answer &lt;code&gt;quit=1&lt;/code&gt; when it has no token. Your SSH
agent is still forwarded: the firewall blocks port 22, but it can still sign. For full
isolation use &lt;a href="../container/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-run&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A git worktree does not work as the workspace, because its &lt;code&gt;.git&lt;/code&gt; points outside the mount.
Open a clone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network access beyond the allowlist needs a change to &lt;code&gt;allowed-domains&lt;/code&gt; and a rebuild.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For an image without the Feature, see
&lt;a href="../../guides/image-without-feature/"&gt;Use the scripts in your own image&lt;/a&gt;. To use the GitHub MCP
server, see &lt;a href="../../reference/client-cli/#agent-github-mcp"&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-github-mcp&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Kubernetes</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/kubernetes/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/dev/docs/getting-started/kubernetes/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Deploy the broker with the Helm chart. Create the two GitHub Apps first, as described in
&lt;a href="../../guides/github-apps/"&gt;Set up the GitHub Apps&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The image is &lt;code&gt;ghcr.io/pflege-de-labs/token-broker&lt;/code&gt;; the chart is published to
&lt;code&gt;oci://ghcr.io/pflege-de-labs/charts/token-broker&lt;/code&gt;. The chart has no deployment-specific defaults.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="1-create-the-secret"&gt;1. Create the Secret&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="1-create-the-secret"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#1-create-the-secret" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;kubectl create secret generic token-broker-credentials &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; --from-file&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;private-key.pem&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;agent-app&amp;gt;.private-key.pem &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; --from-literal&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;login-client-secret&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$LOGIN_CLIENT_SECRET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="2-write-the-values"&gt;2. Write the values&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="2-write-the-values"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#2-write-the-values" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;existingSecret&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;token-broker-credentials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;config&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;appId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;lt;agent app ID&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;my-org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;loginClientId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;lt;login app client ID&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;config.org&lt;/code&gt; is a comma-separated list; only repositories of these organizations get tokens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="3-install"&gt;3. Install&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="3-install"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#3-install" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;helm install token-broker oci://ghcr.io/pflege-de-labs/charts/token-broker &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; --namespace token-broker --create-namespace -f values.yaml&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="4-expose-it"&gt;4. Expose it&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="4-expose-it"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#4-expose-it" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Developers and runners with internal network access reach the broker through &lt;code&gt;ingress&lt;/code&gt; or
&lt;code&gt;httpRoute&lt;/code&gt;. Keep that route internal: the device-flow client ID is public, so a reachable broker
invites phishing. Workflows on GitHub-hosted runners need the public &lt;code&gt;actionsRoute&lt;/code&gt;, which
forwards only &lt;code&gt;POST&lt;/code&gt; on one path to &lt;code&gt;/token/actions&lt;/code&gt;
(&lt;a href="../../guides/actions/"&gt;details&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The broker needs outbound access to &lt;code&gt;api.github.com&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;token.actions.githubusercontent.com&lt;/code&gt;
only; GitHub never calls it. Run it behind TLS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check it with &lt;code&gt;GET /healthz&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;GET /readyz&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;/readyz&lt;/code&gt; succeeds when GitHub accepts the app key.
See &lt;a href="../../reference/helm-values/"&gt;Helm values&lt;/a&gt; and
&lt;a href="../../reference/broker-config/"&gt;broker configuration&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>